# ─── Cricket Tournament Platform — Environment Variable Reference ──────────────
#
# This file documents every VITE_* variable the app requires.
# It is NOT loaded by Vite — it is documentation only.
#
# ── Local development ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#   Vite automatically loads .env.development for `npm run dev`.
#   That file already contains correct localhost defaults.
#   If you need machine-specific overrides, create .env.development.local
#   (already in .gitignore) and set values there.
#
# ── Production (Vercel) ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#   Set these in: Vercel Dashboard → Project → Settings → Environment Variables
#   Do NOT create a .env.production file — Vercel injects these at build time.
#
# IMPORTANT — URL format:
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL and VITE_WS_BASE_URL accept either form:
#     https://titan-cricket-backend.onrender.com          ← host only
#     https://titan-cricket-backend.onrender.com/api/v1  ← host + prefix (preferred)
#   The /api/v1 suffix is guaranteed by the app code even if omitted.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ─── Backend REST API ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://titan-cricket-backend.onrender.com/api/v1

# ─── Backend WebSocket ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
VITE_WS_BASE_URL=wss://titan-cricket-backend.onrender.com/api/v1

# ─── App metadata ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
VITE_APP_NAME="Cricket Tournament Platform"
VITE_APP_VERSION=0.1.0
